{
  "_comment": "Labelled prompts for the Decision Engine eval harness. expected_intent uses the IntentType taxonomy (CHAT/RESEARCH/CODING/FILE/AUTOMATION). expected_mode uses the target taxonomy (CHAT/MISSION); the current ExecutionModeRouter emits AGENT, which the adapter maps to MISSION. Cases tagged ch4.5 are the specification's own examples.",
