    {
      "prompt": "Explain Python",
      "expected_intent": "CHAT",
      "expected_mode": "CHAT",
      "tags": [
        "ch4.5",
        "relabelled"
      ],
      "note": "Relabelled from CODING to CHAT. intent selects capability/model; a definitional question needs no special capability regardless of subject. Keeping CODING made the fixture inconsistent with \"What is a research paper?\"->CHAT and \"Tell me about the file system\"->CHAT. Mode stays CHAT either way, which is all Ch. 4.5 actually asserts."
    },
